{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:MolecularConstruction.MolecularBraid","@type":"LeanModule","name":"MolecularConstruction.MolecularBraid","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.BigOperators.Group.Finset.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Fintype.Fin"],"declarations":7,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.MolecularBraid.sharedElectrons","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.MolecularBraid.sharedElectrons","kind":"def","line":27,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/molecular-construction/molecular-braid.lean#L27-L27","doc":"Total electrons shared in bonds. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.MolecularBraid.bondOrder","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.MolecularBraid.bondOrder","kind":"def","line":25,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/molecular-construction/molecular-braid.lean#L25-L25","doc":"Bond order for each bond. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.MolecularBraid.numBonds","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.MolecularBraid.numBonds","kind":"def","line":23,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/molecular-construction/molecular-braid.lean#L23-L23","doc":"Number of covalent bonds. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.MolecularBraid.totalStrands","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.MolecularBraid.totalStrands","kind":"def","line":21,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/molecular-construction/molecular-braid.lean#L21-L21","doc":"Total strand count N_mol. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.MolecularBraid.numAtoms","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.MolecularBraid.numAtoms","kind":"def","line":19,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/molecular-construction/molecular-braid.lean#L19-L19","doc":"Number of atoms in the molecule. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.MolecularBraid.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.MolecularBraid.mk","kind":"ctor","line":17,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/molecular-construction/molecular-braid.lean#L17-L17","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.MolecularBraid","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.MolecularBraid","kind":"structure","line":9,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/molecular-construction/molecular-braid.lean#L9-L27","doc":"A **molecular braid** is an element of H_{N_mol}(q) assembled from\npre-computed atomic braids by:\n1. Embedding atoms in the Hecke algebra of the combined strand count\n2. Applying inter-atomic crossings (covalent channels)\n3. Hopf-linking shared electron trefoils\n4. Reducing to Hecke normal form\n\nBinding energy: E_bind = α(Σᵢ Φ₁(Aᵢ) − Φ₁(M)). ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:molecular-braid","label":"def:molecular-braid","md":"quantum-observable-universe/molecular-construction/molecular-braid.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}